  "qid": "topicU5Om4qeJWDc9Pn2A",
  "query": "As a researcher in healthcare, help me understand the relationship between ultra-processed foods and modern health problems. I want to analyze (1) how food processing technologies and additives affect our bodies and brains in ways we're still discovering, (2) how the food industry's marketing and product design influence our eating behaviors and food choices, (3) why some people seem more susceptible to processed food addiction and health effects than others, and (4) how environmental factors like food deserts and economic inequality complicate individual choice. Show me the latest research worldwide on food science and public health policy approaches, including both peer-reviewed scientific studies and accessible policy reports. The report is expected to be scientific and scholarly."
}
